text: >-
  / Editing

  ....

  ... .

  Utah Valley.

  **this is not able to be independently confirmed.

  July 20th: BTT from Cairo through Paris to Omaha Nebraska 11:37am, departs at
  5:05pm to

  head to lincoln Nebraska.

  July 22nd: It's announced in Nebraska that they are going to do a trade and
  investment trip with

  Egypt. Private off record meeting has taken place to make this happened. With
  "international

  professionals" per media. Who were these professionals who met with Bob Even?

  July 26th: Departs Wilmington, DE back to Cairo on the 26th

  July 20th-ish: Charlie vacations in Maine for a couple of weeks with his
  family. Goes off radar.

  Mikey McCoy and his wife Eliza join them for the first time.

  July 25th: Charlie was speaking at for "Legacy of Freedom" in Westchester, NY

  End of July: YREFY comes in as the number one sponsor for a Charlie Kirk Fall
  tour.

  VERY EARLY August: (exact date pending) Turning Point sends people out to
  scout a location

  for their event. The school suggests they DO NOT seat Charlie in the
  amphitheater. Turning Point

  insists it's the best location.

  August 2nd: French legionnaires arrive in America for a 3 week training in
  California. Will end on

  the 25th.
